  "description": "Yujin is a “normal” teenager who’s preparing to retake his college entrance exams. He is not into boys. Nope. At least that’s what he tells himself when his classmate, Jun-hyeok, starts hitting on him. But as time goes on, Yujin can’t deny his increasing attraction to Jun-hyeok and reluctantly admits that he’s probably as straight as a circle. But even if Yujin accepts his sexuality, will his and Jun-hyeok’s love prevail successful against all odds, or will it succumb to societal pressure?\nBR> (Source: Lezhin US)",
